### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081
@dockerUrl = http://user-service:8081
@contentType = application/json

### ─── READ ALL USERS ───
### Returns all seeded users (john_doe, jane_smith, bob_wilson)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ USER BY ID ───
### Fetch user 1 (john_doe)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/1
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── READ USER BY ID (non-existent) ───
### Should return 404 - tests error handling
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/users/999
Accept: {{contentType}}

### ─── CREATE NEW USER ───
### Creates a new active user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "alice_wonder",
  "email": "alice@example.com",
  "fullName": "Alice Wonderland"
}

### ─── CREATE DUPLICATE USER ───
### Should fail due to unique constraint on username/email
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/users
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "duplicate@example.com",
  "fullName": "Duplicate User"
}

### ─── MCP TOOL DISCOVERY (SSE) ───
### Verifies MCP server is exposing tools; returns tool list
GET {{baseUrl}}/mcp/sse
Accept: text/event-stream

### ─── HEALTH CHECK ───
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Accept: {{contentType}}